  "goodToKnow": "Humanitär means humanitarian: humanitäre Hilfe, ein humanitärer Korridor, eine humanitäre Katastrophe. Germany is one of the world's largest donors of humanitarian aid. The German Red Cross (DRK) and THW (Technisches Hilfswerk, a federal civil protection agency staffed largely by volunteers) often help abroad. The German word human means humane, not human: humane Bedingungen. Stressed on the last syllable."
